    READING: 32 pi carries no geometry beyond the integer 4 (= 1/kappa^2); its pi is Einstein's normalisation.  The horizon reading that makes it look geometric describes a horizon no spacetime with this Lambda can have, and the data cannot pick 1/2 out of the simple constants around it.  The one-half can only come from dynamics -- which k01-k04 show the present action class does not supply.

